  m_Name: Object_13
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Gasket
  description: The Gasket, positioned at the middle-center-rear of the engine, is
    a small, thin-flat, metal-bright component that seals and separates critical
    engine components. Its small size and thin shape enable it to fit in tight spaces,
    while its metal-bright material provides exceptional strength and durability.
    Interestingly, the Gasket's position at the rear of the engine allows it to prevent
    fluid leaks and maintain engine efficiency.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
